{"id":"93fe0da744c955c6","group":"93","path":"93/93-prop-algebraic-semantics.md","title":"Algebraic Semantics","display":"Algebraic Semantics","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-prop-algebraic-semantics","aliases":["93-prop-algebraic-semantics"],"display":"Algebraic Semantics","authors":"W. J. Blok, Don Pigozzi","book_title":"Algebraizable Logics","depends_on":["[[93-df-logic]]","[[93-df-algebraizable]]","[[93-df-variety]]","[[93-df-formula]]","[[93-df-equation]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-prop-algebraic-semantics"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-prop-algebraic-semantics</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Algebraic Semantics"},{"key":"authors","html":"W. J. Blok, Don Pigozzi"},{"key":"book_title","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"bd7e4207897c8db3\" href=\"?note=bd7e4207897c8db3\" title=\"93-df-logic\">93-df-logic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a55351eb48f8bd69\" href=\"?note=a55351eb48f8bd69\" title=\"93-df-algebraizable\">93-df-algebraizable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f0b0edbaa6696a1d\" href=\"?note=f0b0edbaa6696a1d\" title=\"93-df-variety\">93-df-variety</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"c2ca1af9af149e69\" href=\"?note=c2ca1af9af149e69\" title=\"93-df-formula\">93-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"1e2cbe43bd24f67f\" href=\"?note=1e2cbe43bd24f67f\" title=\"93-df-equation\">93-df-equation</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"prop-algebraic-semantics-—-Algebraic-Semantics\">prop-algebraic-semantics — Algebraic Semantics</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal V\">\\(\\mathcal V\\)</span> is a variety candidate and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Algz}_{93}(\\mathcal L,\\mathcal V;\\tau_{\\mathcal L})\">\\(\\mathrm{Algz}_{93}(\\mathcal L,\\mathcal V;\\tau_{\\mathcal L})\\)</span> has the two-translation meaning of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"a55351eb48f8bd69\" href=\"?note=a55351eb48f8bd69\" title=\"93-df-algebraizable\">93-df-algebraizable</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Fm}_{93}(\\tau_{\\mathcal L})\">\\(\\operatorname{Fm}_{93}(\\tau_{\\mathcal L})\\)</span> is the formula carrier at the explicitly supplied signature; the logic carrier and its consequence relation are recovered from <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L\">\\(\\mathcal L\\)</span> below.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\boldsymbol\\tau[\\Sigma]=\\bigcup_{\\psi\\in\\Sigma}\\boldsymbol\\tau(\\psi)\">\\(\\boldsymbol\\tau[\\Sigma]=\\bigcup_{\\psi\\in\\Sigma}\\boldsymbol\\tau(\\psi)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\models^{\\mathrm{eq}}_{\\mathcal V;\\tau_{\\mathcal L}}\">\\(\\models^{\\mathrm{eq}}_{\\mathcal V;\\tau_{\\mathcal L}}\\)</span> is equational consequence in <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal V\">\\(\\mathcal V\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Eq}_{\\tau_{\\mathcal L}}(\\mathrm{Var}_{93})\">\\(\\mathrm{Eq}_{\\tau_{\\mathcal L}}(\\mathrm{Var}_{93})\\)</span> is the equation set sourced through <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"1e2cbe43bd24f67f\" href=\"?note=1e2cbe43bd24f67f\" title=\"93-df-equation\">93-df-equation</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}algebraic\\text{-}semantics}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Algz}_{93}(\\mathcal L,\\mathcal V;\\tau_{\\mathcal L})\\to\n\\exists F\\;\\exists\\vdash_{\\mathcal L}\\;\\exists\\boldsymbol\\tau\\;\\Bigl[\nF=\\operatorname{Fm}_{93}(\\tau_{\\mathcal L})\n\\land\\mathcal L=\\langle F,\\vdash_{\\mathcal L}\\rangle\n\\land\\boldsymbol\\tau:F\\to[\\mathrm{Eq}_{\\tau_{\\mathcal L}}(\\mathrm{Var}_{93})]^{&lt;\\omega}\n\\land\\forall\\Sigma\\subseteq F\\;\\forall\\phi\\in F\\;\n\\Bigl(\\Sigma\\vdash_{\\mathcal L}\\phi\\leftrightarrow\n\\boldsymbol\\tau[\\Sigma]\\models^{\\mathrm{eq}}_{\\mathcal V;\\tau_{\\mathcal L}}\\boldsymbol\\tau(\\phi)\\Bigr)\\Bigr]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}algebraic\\text{-}semantics}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Algz}_{93}(\\mathcal L,\\mathcal V;\\tau_{\\mathcal L})\\to\n\\exists F\\;\\exists\\vdash_{\\mathcal L}\\;\\exists\\boldsymbol\\tau\\;\\Bigl[\nF=\\operatorname{Fm}_{93}(\\tau_{\\mathcal L})\n\\land\\mathcal L=\\langle F,\\vdash_{\\mathcal L}\\rangle\n\\land\\boldsymbol\\tau:F\\to[\\mathrm{Eq}_{\\tau_{\\mathcal L}}(\\mathrm{Var}_{93})]^{&lt;\\omega}\n\\land\\forall\\Sigma\\subseteq F\\;\\forall\\phi\\in F\\;\n\\Bigl(\\Sigma\\vdash_{\\mathcal L}\\phi\\leftrightarrow\n\\boldsymbol\\tau[\\Sigma]\\models^{\\mathrm{eq}}_{\\mathcal V;\\tau_{\\mathcal L}}\\boldsymbol\\tau(\\phi)\\Bigr)\\Bigr]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>The proposition uses the specific translations witnessing algebraizability; an arbitrary sound algebraic semantics need not be equivalent in this bidirectional sense.  Recovering <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> from the signature prevents the statement from silently replacing the logic's carrier by the unrelated book-level alias <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_{93}\\)</span>.</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"prop-algebraic-semantics-—-Algebraic-Semantics","text":"prop-algebraic-semantics — Algebraic Semantics","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-logic","status":"resolved","id":"bd7e4207897c8db3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-logic]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-algebraizable","status":"resolved","id":"a55351eb48f8bd69","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-algebraizable]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-variety","status":"resolved","id":"f0b0edbaa6696a1d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-variety]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"c2ca1af9af149e69","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-equation","status":"resolved","id":"1e2cbe43bd24f67f","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-equation]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-algebraizable","status":"resolved","id":"a55351eb48f8bd69","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal V$ is a variety candidate and $\\mathrm{Algz}_{93}(\\mathcal L,\\mathcal V;\\tau_{\\mathcal L})$ has the two-translation meaning of [[93-df-algebraizable]].","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-equation","status":"resolved","id":"1e2cbe43bd24f67f","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Eq}_{\\tau_{\\mathcal L}}(\\mathrm{Var}_{93})$ is the equation set sourced through [[93-df-equation]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Algz}_{93}(\\mathcal L,\\mathcal V;\\tau_{\\mathcal L})","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Fm}_{93}(\\tau_{\\mathcal L})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L","display":false},{"tex":"\\boldsymbo